		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content 2|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title 2|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title 2|
	And WebContent view Categorization Category CP
		|categoryNameList|Category Name|
		|vocabularyName|Vocabulary Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Staging Site
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
